{"seq":12,"slug":"metaprogramming","title":"元编程","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":4,"docCount":14,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/metaprogramming","rating":{"composite":3.57,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"元编程-简介\">元编程 简介</h1><p>通常，我们写程序是为了处理数据——数字、文本、图像。但有一类特殊而强大的技术，让程序得以把&quot;代码本身&quot;当作数据来处理：读取代码、生成代码、修改代码、乃至在运行时改变自己的行为。这便是&quot;元编程&quot;——编写&quot;操纵程序的程序&quot;。元编程是许多框架的魔法之源，也是语言表达力的高级体现；它威力惊人，却也以晦涩与风险著称。</p>\n<p>本知识库面向已具备一门语言基础、希望理解&quot;程序如何操纵程序&quot;的读者，分四章讲解元编程的核心理念、反射、编译期手段、运行时手段与意义，跨越具体语言把握其本质。</p>\n<p><strong>第一章·元编程基础</strong>阐明元编程的根本理念——&quot;代码即数据&quot;，并厘清编译期与运行时这两大施展元编程的时机，建立整体认知。</p>\n<p><strong>第二章·反射与内省</strong>讲解程序在运行时&quot;审视并操纵自身&quot;的能力——内省（查看自己的结构）与反射（据此动态地调用、构造），及其应用与代价。</p>\n<p><strong>第三章·编译期元编程</strong>剖析在&quot;代码变成程序之前&quot;做文章的手段——宏（文本宏与句法宏）、代码生成、以及模板与领域专用语言，及其卫生与安全。</p>\n<p><strong>第四章·运行时元编程与意义</strong>介绍在程序&quot;运行起来之后&quot;动态改变其行为的手段（动态求值、动态修改、代理拦截），并上升到何时该用、何时该避、不同语言的元编程哲学与整体意义。</p>\n<p>建议按章节顺序阅读。第一章建立&quot;代码即数据&quot;的核心认知，第二章理解运行时的自省能力，第三章掌握编译期的生成手段，第四章综观运行时手段、取舍与意义。阅读时不妨把握一条主线：元编程让程序能够把代码当作可读、可写、可改的数据来操纵，从而获得惊人的抽象能力与灵活性；但这种&quot;凌驾于代码之上&quot;的能力也带来晦涩与风险，故其精髓不在炫技，而在审慎而克制地运用，以驯服复杂、而非制造复杂。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"metaprogramming-foundations","title":"第一章 元编程基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/metaprogramming/metaprogramming-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-metaprogramming","title":"什么是元编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/metaprogramming/metaprogramming-foundations/what-is-metaprogramming"},{"seq":2,"slug":"code-as-data","title":"代码即数据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/metaprogramming/metaprogramming-foundations/code-as-data"},{"seq":3,"slug":"compile-time-vs-runtime","title":"编译期与运行时","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/metaprogramming/metaprogramming-foundations/compile-time-vs-runtime"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"reflection-and-introspection","title":"第二章 反射与内省","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/metaprogramming/reflection-and-introspection","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"reflection-and-introspection","title":"内省与反射","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/metaprogramming/reflection-and-introspection/reflection-and-introspection"},{"seq":2,"slug":"what-reflection-can-do","title":"反射能做什么","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/metaprogramming/reflection-and-introspection/what-reflection-can-do"},{"seq":3,"slug":"reflection-applications-and-cost","title":"反射的应用与代价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/metaprogramming/reflection-and-introspection/reflection-applications-and-cost"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"compile-time-metaprogramming","title":"第三章 编译期元编程","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/metaprogramming/compile-time-metaprogramming","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"macros","title":"宏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/metaprogramming/compile-time-metaprogramming/macros"},{"seq":2,"slug":"syntactic-macros-and-hygiene","title":"句法宏与卫生","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/metaprogramming/compile-time-metaprogramming/syntactic-macros-and-hygiene"},{"seq":3,"slug":"code-generation","title":"代码生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/metaprogramming/compile-time-metaprogramming/code-generation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"templates-and-dsl","title":"模板与领域专用语言","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/metaprogramming/compile-time-metaprogramming/templates-and-dsl"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"runtime-and-significance","title":"第四章 运行时元编程与意义","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/metaprogramming/runtime-and-significance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dynamic-evaluation","title":"动态求值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/metaprogramming/runtime-and-significance/dynamic-evaluation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dynamic-modification","title":"动态修改与代理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/metaprogramming/runtime-and-significance/dynamic-modification"},{"seq":3,"slug":"when-to-use-and-avoid","title":"取舍与实践智慧","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/metaprogramming/runtime-and-significance/when-to-use-and-avoid"},{"seq":4,"slug":"significance","title":"意义与语言哲学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/metaprogramming/runtime-and-significance/significance"}]}]}